    "unsupported": [
      "The rolling, ridge and low-blunder scenes. On those three the two implementations disagree about 4384, 2532 and 2897 returns, and every disagreeing return but one is bare earth as the scene was built: our filter rejects ground that the reference accepts. Nothing about those datasets is approved by this study.",
